      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Feb-10-2005 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled for OSC hearing for Change of Name of a Minor.<br>Commissioner: Sue Kaplan, Clerk: S. Ravinantapricha/E. Estacio, CSR: Tony Vaughn.<br>Petitioner: Laura R. Zander, present in pro per as Guardian ad litem for the Minor: Daniel Marc Duran, was sworn and examined.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct, and sufficient and that the petition should be granted.<br><br>The Court grants the petition for Change of Name of a Minor to: DANIEL MARC ZANDER.<br>Decree signed in open court.<br><br>",
